## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical data retention, crash safety, and background work in a real-world iOS data app.

## Key Concepts
- SQLite/GRDB data modeling for time-series data
- Per-symbol retention with separate archives
- Crash-safe resume and idempotent pruning
- Background tasks (BGAppRefreshTask) and battery awareness
- User-initiated export of pruned data

